<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL 69-4 AT LUNCH AGAINST BORDER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL 69-4 AT LUNCH AGAINST BORDER.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal were 69 for four in their first innings at lunch on the opening day of their four-day Supersport Series cricket match against Border at Kingsmead on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Natal 69-4 in 31 overs (Dale Benkenstein 24 not out; Vasbert Drakes 2-20).</p>
</text>
